{"id":"wb-4-105","name":"赣州城墙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"赣州城墙","text":"赣州城墙，位于中国江西省赣州市章贡区，主要建于宋、明两代，是中国现存最长、保存最完整的一处宋代城墙，1987年被列为江西省文物保护单位，1996年被列为第四批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B5%A3%E5%B7%9E%E5%9F%8E%E5%A2%99","revisionId":87934795,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=87934795","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2b99d005db3663a8d502e4e5.jpg","title":"Bajing_Pavilion.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bajing_Pavilion.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6b/Bajing_Pavilion.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Liangxiao","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"Bajing Pavilion(八境台), Ganzhou, Jiangxi Province, China","width":320,"height":240}}